  "explain": {
   "ko": "장소로 갈 때는 go to, 교통수단은 by를 씁니다: I go to work by bus. 택시나 버스는 take로도 말합니다.",
   "en": "Use 'go to' for a place and 'by' for transport: I go to work by bus. You can also use 'take' for a taxi or a bus."
  },
